@startuml SequenceDiagram_Home_Browse_Nozie
' Home & Browse content flow - Nozie (simplified)
' Render: PlantUML, or https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml/uml/
!theme plain
title Home & Browse Content - Nozie (Simplified)

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 120

actor User
participant "GoRouter" as Router
participant "HomeScreen" as Home
participant "Providers" as Prov
participant "MovieRepository" as MovieRepo
participant "WishlistNotifier" as Wishlist
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "Movie Service" as MovieSvc

== Open Home ==
User -> Router : Tap Home (bottom nav)
Router -> Home : /home (ShellRoute)
Home -> Prov : watch trending, recommended, genres, countries, years, wishlist, recent
Prov -> MovieRepo : streamTrending, streamRecommendations, getGenres, getCountries, getYears, streamTopNewReleases
Prov -> Wishlist : getWatchlist (wishlistProvider)
MovieRepo -> GW : GET /movies/trending, /recommendations, /genres, /countries, /years, /movies/latest
Wishlist -> GW : GET /user/{id}/watchlist
GW -> MovieSvc : catalog APIs
MovieSvc --> GW : lists (movies, genres, countries, years)
GW --> MovieRepo : data
GW --> Wishlist : watchlist
MovieRepo --> Prov : Stream/Future data
Wishlist --> Prov : list
Prov --> Home : data
Home -> User : Show sections: Trending, Recommended, Explore by Genre/Country/Year, Wishlist, Recently Watched

== Browse: tap movie ==
User -> Home : Tap movie card
Home -> Router : push /movie/:id
Router -> User : MovieDetailScreen

== Browse: tap More ==
User -> Home : Tap "More" on section
Home -> Router : push /movie-type/recommended | wishlist | recent
Router -> User : MovieTypeScreen (list by type)

== Browse: tap Explore ==
User -> Home : Tap genre / country / year
Home -> Router : push /movie-carousel-genre/:slug or explore/:name or carousel-year/:year
Router -> User : ExploreGenreDetails or ExploreGenre

@enduml
